Package: generalClusterExp
Type: Package
Title: General Cluster Experiment Estimators under Network Interference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yihui", "He", email = "yihuihe@upenn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the MRN, IPTW, and CRN linear-weighted Hajek estimators
    for cluster-randomized experiments with cross-cluster network interference,
    together with conservative HAC variance estimators, following He and
    Tchetgen Tchetgen (2026) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2607.04644>. Each top-level
    function returns the overall, direct, indirect and total causal effects,
    all well-defined marginal and non-marginal population average potential
    outcomes, and variance estimates for every quantity. The estimands and
    identification weights follow Section 3 of the paper (Theorems 3.6 and 3.7
    and Proposition 3.9); the estimators follow Section 4; the variance
    estimators follow Section 5 (Theorem 5.4 for the Loewner-max kernel under
    cluster-level Bernoulli randomization, Theorem 5.9 for the cluster-agnostic
    K3+ kernel, and Theorem 5.11 for the bias-corrected estimator under
    complete randomization).
